t'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Please note change in<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:14.85pt'>\r\n  <td width=313 valign=top style='width:234.75pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=151 valign=top style='width:4.0cm;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=81 valign=top style='width:60.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=222 valign=top style='width:166.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>reference\r\n  range and method<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Interpretation:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>1. <\/span><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Is used for the\r\nquantitative detection of autoantibodies of IgA class directed against tissue\r\ntransglutaminase (tTG) in human<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>serum or plasma<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>2. <\/span><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>tTG is a\r\ncalcium-dependent enzyme widely distributed in body fluids and tissues\r\nespecially the gastrointestinal submucosa.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>tTG activity is\r\nincreased in the jejunal mucosa in Celiac disease\/Gluten sensitive enteropathy,\r\nwhich is a chronic condition<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>affecting genetically\r\nsusceptible individuals.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>3. <\/span><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Untreated subjects may\r\nbe asymptomatic or may suffer from failure to thrive, diarrhoea,\r\ngastrointestinal disorder anaemia,<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>chronic fatigue or\r\npsychiatric problems<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>4. <\/span><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>In conjunction with\r\nother tests it aids in the diagnosis of celiac disease.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify;text-autospace:none'><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>5. <\/span><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>IgA correlates with\r\ndisease activity and is thus of paramount importance for diet monitoring. It\r\nmay also help in detection of untreated subclinical cases<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ASSOCIATED TESTS\r\n:<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 1. <\/span><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Gliadin antibodies (IgG\r\nand IgA)<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 2. <\/span><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>Endomysial antibodies<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-autospace:none'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 3. <\/span><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Arial\",sans-serif'>HLA-DQ2\/DQ8<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251658240;left:-62px;\r\ntop:413px;width:1047px;height:416px'><img width=838 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlhF